<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC ALMOST CERTAIN TO MEET NEXT IN JAKARTA-LUKMAN.</title>
<headline>OPEC ALMOST CERTAIN TO MEET NEXT IN JAKARTA-LUKMAN.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC Secretary General Rilwanu Lukman said on Thursday that Indonesia had invited OPEC to hold its next conference, due in November, in Jakarta.</p>
<p>He said that it was &quot;almost certain&quot; that the ministers would agree to the invitation.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
